lyrics:
God who led the generations
Through the desert, through the sea,
Will not leave us nor forsake us;
He will lead us faithfully.

We have stood beside the river,
Fearing what the flood would bring;
Lord, forgive our anxious doubting,
Teach our trembling hearts to sing.

Let Your word be our companion
Night and day upon the way;
Send us out to serve our neighbors,
Strong to love and quick to pray.

Rise and cross the morning river;
God goes with us, high and low;
Praise the Father, Son, and Spirit
Everywhere our feet may go.
